# Manual license server and license log path list for the LOG CURVE tab.
# One license server per line, format:
#   ServerName:/path/to/license.log
# Empty lines and lines starting with "#" are ignored.
# The license log is read from the license server over SSH (incremental).
#
# Copy this file to license_log_server.init and uncomment/modify the lines:
#
# MasterServer:/apps/eda/license.log
# 27000@lic_server_01:/var/flexnet/lmgrd.log
